00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:39.530
so it seems like she's been waiting for
a really really long time

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:43.310
why then are we able to challenge
nashandra over and over again in the

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:44.180
throne room

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:47.690
once we've lost shouldn't she have
already won I mean she's just standing

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:49.250
there in front of the throne

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:53.030
shouldn't she have the ability to ascend
it for herself and the only reasonable

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:58.640
explanation to this is a) that it's a
