which means that she clearly knows very
little about what the throne is even

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:07.160
after craving it so much

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:10.790
her intentions are truly baffling and I
feel like there's something missing here

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:12.260
and i hope that there is

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:16.190
and then there's the ending cutscene
I've always been confused by the

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:20.660
Herald's dialogue here so there's this
cycle where the age of fire fades to

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:25.010
embers and then it's on the cusp of
